# "When this Aura enters, enchanted creature fights up to one target creature an opponent controls" (CR 701.14a): Bot1's
# Edge Rover, a 2/2, is enchanted, so it is 2/4 ("gets +0/+2") by the time the trigger resolves. It and Bot2's Curious Farm
# Animals (1/1) deal damage equal to their power to each other: the Farm Animals die (Bot2 gains 3 from its own trigger), and
# the Rover keeps 1 damage. It has "can't be blocked by more than one creature" (CR 509.1b) beside its reach.

